=== Adaptor cost: NIST ML-DSA vs the LAS paper's simplified Dilithium ===
build: commit c4064a2 branch final-report-audit | ML-DSA-65 vs Simplified Dilithium-III (n=6, l=5, kappa=49)
protocol: 5 repetitions x 500 (sign-class) / 1000 (verify-class) iterations, mean +/- SD, same process

--- run-validity gates (a failure invalidates every timing above) ---
rejection gate [simplified Dilithium: Algorithm 1 Sign]: 2500 calls, measured 2.7348 attempts/call (acceptance 36.57%) vs exact theory 2.7188 (36.78%), 5-sigma tolerance +-0.2162 => OK
rejection gate [simplified Dilithium: Algorithm 2 PreSign]: 2500 calls, measured 2.8392 attempts/call (acceptance 35.22%) vs exact theory 2.7748 (36.04%), 5-sigma tolerance +-0.2219 => OK
rejection gate [ML-DSA: Sign (matched, no statement)]: 2500 calls, measured 5.2512 attempts/call (acceptance 19.04%) vs FIPS 204 published 5.1000 (19.61%), 5-sigma tolerance +-0.4573 => OK
rejection gate [ML-DSA: PreSign (adaptor)]: 2500 calls, measured 5.2332 attempts/call (acceptance 19.11%) vs FIPS 204 published 5.1000 (19.61%), 5-sigma tolerance +-0.4573 => OK

